### Dataset & Educational Scope Notice

The source code, automated pipelines, testing suites, and analytical reports in this
repository are licensed under the MIT License above.

The accompanying rental datasets (`data/cairo_rentals.csv` and `data/district_info.csv`)
are provided exclusively as a simulated, semi-synthetic benchmark dataset for educational
data engineering, quality auditing, and portfolio demonstration. They do not constitute
official real-estate registry records, commercial lease agreements, or financial advice.
